  (text "SN74AHCT125N - Quadruple Bus Buffer\nLevel Shifter 3.3V → 5V\n\nJ1: Input (ESP32 3.3V side)\nJ2: Output (5V side)\nC1: 100nF Bypass Capacitor\n\nTie ~{OE} pins LOW to enable outputs"
